{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b9a3c6de-8f62-4d1b-9d6d-5df7f1b3f9a1",
    "name": "FeedProvider Admin & User APIs",
    "description": "Postman collection for current FeedProvider APIs.\n\nAuth flow:\n1) /auth/signup (optional)\n2) /auth/login to get jwt_token and api_token\n3) Use Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token> for /api and /admin routes\n\nWebSocket Feed:\n- URL: ws://localhost:8081/feed?token={{jwt_token}}\n\nZerodha session flow (admin):\n1) Login as admin and get jwt_token\n2) Obtain fresh request_token from Zerodha login (single-use, short-lived)\n3) Call POST /admin/zerodha/session with request_token (send token only, not callback URL)\n4) Access token is stored in DB and feed service uses latest active token\n5) Check status using GET /admin/zerodha/session/status",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
